{"reference":"Psalms 114","book":"Psalms","chapter":114,"status":"pending","sections":[{"kind":"surrounding_passages","title":"Nearby Psalms","blocks":[{"id":"block_1","text":"The surrounding collection includes communal psalms that preserve memories of sanctuary destruction and Babylonian exile, alongside return thanksgiving, festival praise, Torah meditation, and Songs of Ascents oriented toward worship. Psalm numbering can differ in Greek and Latin Psalters, which commonly join Psalms 114 and 115; readers using those traditions may therefore find this psalm numbered differently.","verse_refs":["Psalms 113:1-9","Psalms 115:1-18","Psalms 116:1-19","Psalms 117:1-2","Psalms 118:1-29"],"provenance_refs":["reader_path_psalms_114_c2299674c1de7df9db31a04d"],"confidence":"high","interpretation_level":"disputed"}]}],"generated_metadata":null}